WEBVTT

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:03.184
And as Europe moves [towards] a union
that's based more on values

00:08:03.208 --> 00:08:05.726
and less on geography,

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.434
its contours

00:08:07.458 --> 00:08:09.393
and those values themselves

00:08:09.417 --> 00:08:11.643
will increasingly be defined

00:08:11.667 --> 00:08:14.018
by the tension between Brussels

00:08:14.042 --> 00:08:17.476
and countries like Hungary and Poland,

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.393
who are increasingly behaving in ways

00:08:19.417 --> 00:08:22.226
that go against basic values

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.101
such as respect for democracy

00:08:25.125 --> 00:08:26.393
and the rule of law.

00:08:26.417 --> 00:08:28.934
The treatment of women
and the LGBT community

00:08:28.958 --> 00:08:31.934
are other important markers here.